; RT42 / PT42 (#738). Handwritten DXF: square and vertical NET family.
; Exact cardinal transforms, selection on the transformed boundary/interior,
; undo/redo, then Esc before the next transformation gets its base point.
!view 0,0 0.01 800x600
!snap off
; cambia con #699
OPEN
input.dxf
; PT42 makes the stored pattern selectable.
; cambia con #738
ROTATE
0,5

0,0
-90
!click 5,0
!report
!esc
U
!report
REDO
!report
ROTATE
5,-3.175

!esc
!click 5,-3.175
